{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/prosiform/pulls/669","id":5187500980,"node_id":"PR_kwDOVNSvEM8AAAABNTL7tA","html_url":"https://github.com/m2ux/prosiform/pull/669","diff_url":"https://github.com/m2ux/prosiform/pull/669.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/m2ux/prosiform/pull/669.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/prosiform/issues/669","number":669,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"[I10:E07] Explicit presets for entries and links","user":{"login":"m2ux","id":176900785,"node_id":"U_kgDOCotKsQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/176900785?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux","html_url":"https://github.com/m2ux","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/m2ux/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Overview\n\nDelivers I10:E07 W04+W05: one `pf --entry REF` command with optional `--presets PRESETS` selects destination-owned presets through the same comma-separated names as Markdown link titles. Heading words and visible labels select no presets. The CLI, guide, repository callers and checked fixtures share that command specification.\n\n## Changes\n\nExplicit occurrence selections govern compilation and deterministic output naming throughout the single-entry path.\n\n### Command Surface\n\n- **Single entry.**\n  Compilation accepts one `--entry` and at most one `--presets`; bare guide and informational responses remain available.\n- **Agent command specification.**\n  The plain-text guide explains destination resolution, same-file fragments, shell quoting and option values beginning with a dash.\n\n### Preset Activation\n\n- **Shared matching.**\n  Authored links and CLI arguments use one reader; matching presets layer above default and unknown names select nothing.\n- **Selection closure.**\n  Newly activated substitutions reach the fixed point, with depth measured by reference chains rather than traversal rounds.\n- **Qualified outputs.**\n  Effective named selections qualify entry and single dispatched bundle names using captured destination metadata.\n- **Published handoffs.**\n  Final composed source ranges determine scheduled dispatches and self-composition warnings under the stable mapping.\n- **Publication boundary.**\n  Every captured source is checked against the actual entry run folder before publication.\n\n### Callers And Guidance\n\n- **Atomic caller contract.**\n  Active corpus, installed-wheel, deterministic harness and example callers use the single-entry grammar.\n- **Preserved fixture invariants.**\n  Authored links express combined inputs while retaining content, ownership, grouping, ordering and refusal coverage.\n- **Current public guidance.**\n  The invocation, focused guides, glossary and regenerated examples use the pinned explicit-selection design.\n\n## Test Plan\n\n| Test | Description | Coverage | Pass |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| T1 | Actual CLI grammar refusals, empty-list corpus and installed-wheel smoke. | AC8 | [✓](https://github.com/m2ux/prosiform/blob/engineering/artifacts/planning/2026-11-06-662-i10-e07-w04-entries-select-presets-through/validation.md#single-entry-grammar) |\n| T2 | Shared-reader instrumentation and authored-link/CLI activation parity. | AC3, AC9 | [✓](https://github.com/m2ux/prosiform/blob/engineering/artifacts/planning/2026-11-06-662-i10-e07-w04-entries-select-presets-through/validation.md#shared-reader-and-activation) |\n| T3 | Heading/label variations and independent occurrence selections. | AC10 | [✓](https://github.com/m2ux/prosiform/blob/engineering/artifacts/planning/2026-11-06-662-i10-e07-w04-entries-select-presets-through/validation.md#heading-and-label-independence) |\n| T4 | Bare guide checks and executed relative, quoted and leading-dash commands. | AC11 | [✓](https://github.com/m2ux/prosiform/blob/engineering/artifacts/planning/2026-11-06-662-i10-e07-w04-entries-select-presets-through/validation.md#executable-guide-commands) |\n| T5 | Invocation, vocabulary/conformance and all checked example compilations. | AC21 | [✓](https://github.com/m2ux/prosiform/blob/engineering/artifacts/planning/2026-11-06-662-i10-e07-w04-entries-select-presets-through/validation.md#public-guidance-and-examples) |\n| T6 | Required behavior gates and corrected final contract gates. | | [✓](https://github.com/m2ux/prosiform/blob/engineering/artifacts/planning/2026-11-06-662-i10-e07-w04-entries-select-presets-through/validation.md#full-check) |\n| T7 | Source-folder safety, late activation at depth=1 and effective published dispatches. | AC9 | [✓](https://github.com/m2ux/prosiform/blob/engineering/artifacts/planning/2026-11-06-662-i10-e07-w04-entries-select-presets-through/validation.md#runtime-safety-and-fixed-point) |\n\n## References\n\n- **R1.** [Explicit preset-selection design](https://github.com/m2ux/prosiform/blob/795bbfb67c66b02193f0313138f59f18aa6c5274/artifacts/planning/2026-10-17-prosiform-v1/design.md) — link-title selection, single-entry grammar and qualified output names.\n","created_at":"2026-11-06T12:00:52Z","updated_at":"2026-11-06T12:05:38Z","closed_at":"2026-11-06T12:05:38Z","merged_at":"2026-11-06T12:05:38Z","merge_commit_sha":"6578295a1bd40899ab4286a8185203451e159554","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/m2ux/prosiform/pulls/669/commits","review_comments_url":"https://